WHEREAS a Solid Waste Management Plan has been developed by the Heart of Georgia Altamaha Regional Development Center for the jurisdictions in the region;

WHEREAS the plan has been written to be consistent with the Minimum Planning Standards and Procedures for Solid Waste Management established by the State of Georgia;

WHEREAS provisions of the states’ Minimum Planning Standards and Procedures for Solid Waste Management require an update of the Short Term Work Program;

WHEREAS, the plan includes an inventory and assessment of solid waste management practices within the region;

WHEREAS, Treutlen County has held two (2) required public hearings led by the Heart of Georgia Altamaha Regional Development Center on the plan; and

THEREFORE, be it resolved that the Treutlen County Board of Commissioners authorizes the submittal of this Solid Waste Management Plan Short Term Work Program Update to the Heart of Georgia Altamaha Regional Development Center for review, comments, and recommendation upon processing to the Georgia Department of Community Affairs.

Thisthe 5th dayof May , 1998.

Treutlen County

‘Jim L. Gillis, Jr. Chairman Treutlen County Board of Commissioners

